          "prompt": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><p><b>Question 2 (0.25 mark).</b> Edit/replace the data of the resource. Copy the content of the <b>artTools.json</b> file (provided) into the resource so it holds real art-tool records.</p></div><div class=\"ml-vi\"><p><b>Câu 2 (0.25 điểm).</b> Sửa/thay thế dữ liệu của resource. Sao chép nội dung file <b>artTools.json</b> (được cung cấp) vào resource để nó chứa dữ liệu art-tool thật.</p></div>",
          "sampleSolution": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><p>Replace the resource data with the array below (import on mockapi or PUT each item):</p><pre><code>// artTools.json  (paste as the resource data on mockapi -&gt; &quot;Edit&quot; / bulk import)\n[\n  {\n    &quot;id&quot;: &quot;1&quot;,\n    &quot;artName&quot;: &quot;sky acrylic set&quot;,\n    &quot;price&quot;: 25,\n    &quot;description&quot;: &quot;A smooth flowing acrylic paint set for canvas art.&quot;,\n    &quot;glassSurface&quot;: true,\n    &quot;image&quot;: &quot;https://picsum.photos/id/101/300/300&quot;,\n    &quot;brand&quot;: &quot;KingArt&quot;,\n    &quot;limitedTimeDeal&quot;: 0.3\n  },\n  {\n    &quot;id&quot;: &quot;2&quot;,\n    &quot;artName&quot;: &quot;color splash markers&quot;,\n    &quot;price&quot;: 40,\n    &quot;description&quot;: &quot;Dual tip alcohol markers, 24 vivid colors.&quot;,\n    &quot;glassSurface&quot;: false,\n    &quot;image&quot;: &quot;https://picsum.photos/id/102/300/300&quot;,\n    &quot;brand&quot;: &quot;Color Splash&quot;,\n    &quot;limitedTimeDeal&quot;: 0\n  },\n  {\n    &quot;id&quot;: &quot;3&quot;,\n    &quot;artName&quot;: &quot;edding paint pens&quot;,\n    &quot;price&quot;: 15,\n    &quot;description&quot;: &quot;Permanent paint pens for glass and metal.&quot;,\n    &quot;glassSurface&quot;: true,\n    &quot;image&quot;: &quot;https://picsum.photos/id/103/300/300&quot;,\n    &quot;brand&quot;: &quot;Edding&quot;,\n    &quot;limitedTimeDeal&quot;: 0.5\n  },\n  {\n    &quot;id&quot;: &quot;4&quot;,\n    &quot;artName&quot;: &quot;arteza watercolor pad&quot;,\n    &quot;price&quot;: 12,\n    &quot;description&quot;: &quot;Cold-press watercolor paper pad, 30 sheets.&quot;,\n    &quot;glassSurface&quot;: false,\n    &quot;image&quot;: &quot;https://picsum.photos/id/104/300/300&quot;,\n    &quot;brand&quot;: &quot;Arteza&quot;,\n    &quot;limitedTimeDeal&quot;: 0\n  }\n]</code></pre><p><i>Explanation:</i> Some records have <b>limitedTimeDeal = 0</b> (not on sale) and some &gt; 0 (on sale) so that Task 2 (Home shows only <b>limitedTimeDeal = 0</b>) and Task 5 (Detail shows the deal as a percentage) both have data to display. The <b>brand</b> values match the four allowed brands in Task 7.</p></div><div class=\"ml-vi\"><p>Thay dữ liệu resource bằng mảng dưới đây (import trên mockapi hoặc PUT từng item):</p><pre><code>// artTools.json  (paste as the resource data on mockapi -&gt; &quot;Edit&quot; / bulk import)\n[\n  {\n    &quot;id&quot;: &quot;1&quot;,\n    &quot;artName&quot;: &quot;sky acrylic set&quot;,\n    &quot;price&quot;: 25,\n    &quot;description&quot;: &quot;A smooth flowing acrylic paint set for canvas art.&quot;,\n    &quot;glassSurface&quot;: true,\n    &quot;image&quot;: &quot;https://picsum.photos/id/101/300/300&quot;,\n    &quot;brand&quot;: &quot;KingArt&quot;,\n    &quot;limitedTimeDeal&quot;: 0.3\n  },\n  {\n    &quot;id&quot;: &quot;2&quot;,\n    &quot;artName&quot;: &quot;color splash markers&quot;,\n    &quot;price&quot;: 40,\n    &quot;description&quot;: &quot;Dual tip alcohol markers, 24 vivid colors.&quot;,\n    &quot;glassSurface&quot;: false,\n    &quot;image&quot;: &quot;https://picsum.photos/id/102/300/300&quot;,\n    &quot;brand&quot;: &quot;Color Splash&quot;,\n    &quot;limitedTimeDeal&quot;: 0\n  },\n  {\n    &quot;id&quot;: &quot;3&quot;,\n    &quot;artName&quot;: &quot;edding paint pens&quot;,\n    &quot;price&quot;: 15,\n    &quot;description&quot;: &quot;Permanent paint pens for glass and metal.&quot;,\n    &quot;glassSurface&quot;: true,\n    &quot;image&quot;: &quot;https://picsum.photos/id/103/300/300&quot;,\n    &quot;brand&quot;: &quot;Edding&quot;,\n    &quot;limitedTimeDeal&quot;: 0.5\n  },\n  {\n    &quot;id&quot;: &quot;4&quot;,\n    &quot;artName&quot;: &quot;arteza watercolor pad&quot;,\n    &quot;price&quot;: 12,\n    &quot;description&quot;: &quot;Cold-press watercolor paper pad, 30 sheets.&quot;,\n    &quot;glassSurface&quot;: false,\n    &quot;image&quot;: &quot;https://picsum.photos/id/104/300/300&quot;,\n    &quot;brand&quot;: &quot;Arteza&quot;,\n    &quot;limitedTimeDeal&quot;: 0\n  }\n]</code></pre><p><i>Giải thích:</i> Một số bản ghi có <b>limitedTimeDeal = 0</b> (không giảm giá), một số &gt; 0 (đang sale) để Task 2 (Home chỉ hiện <b>limitedTimeDeal = 0</b>) và Task 5 (Detail hiện deal dạng phần trăm) đều có dữ liệu. Giá trị <b>brand</b> khớp 4 brand hợp lệ ở Task 7.</p></div>",
