          "kind": "WRITE",
          "points": 2,
          "prompt": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><p><b>Question 4 (2 marks).</b> At the <b>Home</b> route, display all the art tools in the data that are <b>not on sale (limitedTimeDeal = 0)</b>. Each art tool must show some information such as: <b>artName</b>, ...</p></div><div class=\"ml-vi\"><p><b>Câu 4 (2 điểm).</b> Tại route <b>Home</b>, hiển thị tất cả art tool trong dữ liệu <b>không giảm giá (limitedTimeDeal = 0)</b>. Mỗi art tool phải hiện một số thông tin như: <b>artName</b>, ...</p></div>",
          "sampleSolution": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><p>Fetch from json-server/mockapi and filter by limitedTimeDeal === 0:</p><pre><code>// src/api.js  -&gt;  one place for the endpoint\nimport axios from &quot;axios&quot;;\nimport { USERNAME } from &quot;./App&quot;;\n\n// replace &lt;project-id&gt; with your mockapi project id\nexport const BASE = &quot;https://&lt;project-id&gt;.mockapi.io/&quot; + USERNAME;\nexport const api = axios.create({ baseURL: BASE });\n\n// src/pages/Home.js\nimport { useEffect, useState } from &quot;react&quot;;\nimport { Link } from &quot;react-router-dom&quot;;\nimport { api } from &quot;../api&quot;;\n\nexport default function Home() {\n  const [tools, setTools] = useState([]);\n  const [loading, setLoading] = useState(true);\n\n  useEffect(() =&gt; {\n    api.get(&quot;&quot;)\n      .then((res) =&gt; setTools(res.data))\n      .catch((err) =&gt; console.error(err))\n      .finally(() =&gt; setLoading(false));\n  }, []);\n\n  if (loading) return &lt;p&gt;Loading...&lt;/p&gt;;\n\n  // only items NOT on sale\n  const notOnSale = tools.filter((t) =&gt; Number(t.limitedTimeDeal) === 0);\n\n  return (\n    &lt;div&gt;\n      &lt;h2&gt;Art Tools (not on sale)&lt;/h2&gt;\n      &lt;div style={{ display: &quot;grid&quot;, gridTemplateColumns: &quot;repeat(auto-fill,minmax(220px,1fr))&quot;, gap: 16 }}&gt;\n        {notOnSale.map((t) =&gt; (\n          &lt;div key={t.id} style={{ border: &quot;1px solid #ddd&quot;, borderRadius: 8, padding: 12 }}&gt;\n            &lt;img src={t.image} alt={t.artName} style={{ width: &quot;100%&quot;, height: 160, objectFit: &quot;cover&quot;, borderRadius: 6 }} /&gt;\n            &lt;h3 style={{ textTransform: &quot;capitalize&quot; }}&gt;{t.artName}&lt;/h3&gt;\n            &lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Price:&lt;/b&gt; ${t.price}&lt;/p&gt;\n            &lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Brand:&lt;/b&gt; {t.brand}&lt;/p&gt;\n            &lt;Link to={&quot;/detail/&quot; + t.id}&gt;View detail&lt;/Link&gt;\n          &lt;/div&gt;\n        ))}\n        {notOnSale.length === 0 &amp;&amp; &lt;p&gt;No art tools available.&lt;/p&gt;}\n      &lt;/div&gt;\n    &lt;/div&gt;\n  );\n}</code></pre><p><i>Explanation:</i> <b>useEffect</b> fetches the data once on mount, <b>useState</b> holds it, and <b>filter(t =&gt; Number(t.limitedTimeDeal) === 0)</b> keeps only items that are not on sale. Each card shows the required <b>artName</b> plus image, price and brand, and links to the Detail route.</p></div><div class=\"ml-vi\"><p>Fetch từ json-server/mockapi và lọc theo limitedTimeDeal === 0:</p><pre><code>// src/api.js  -&gt;  one place for the endpoint\nimport axios from &quot;axios&quot;;\nimport { USERNAME } from &quot;./App&quot;;\n\n// replace &lt;project-id&gt; with your mockapi project id\nexport const BASE = &quot;https://&lt;project-id&gt;.mockapi.io/&quot; + USERNAME;\nexport const api = axios.create({ baseURL: BASE });\n\n// src/pages/Home.js\nimport { useEffect, useState } from &quot;react&quot;;\nimport { Link } from &quot;react-router-dom&quot;;\nimport { api } from &quot;../api&quot;;\n\nexport default function Home() {\n  const [tools, setTools] = useState([]);\n  const [loading, setLoading] = useState(true);\n\n  useEffect(() =&gt; {\n    api.get(&quot;&quot;)\n      .then((res) =&gt; setTools(res.data))\n      .catch((err) =&gt; console.error(err))\n      .finally(() =&gt; setLoading(false));\n  }, []);\n\n  if (loading) return &lt;p&gt;Loading...&lt;/p&gt;;\n\n  // only items NOT on sale\n  const notOnSale = tools.filter((t) =&gt; Number(t.limitedTimeDeal) === 0);\n\n  return (\n    &lt;div&gt;\n      &lt;h2&gt;Art Tools (not on sale)&lt;/h2&gt;\n      &lt;div style={{ display: &quot;grid&quot;, gridTemplateColumns: &quot;repeat(auto-fill,minmax(220px,1fr))&quot;, gap: 16 }}&gt;\n        {notOnSale.map((t) =&gt; (\n          &lt;div key={t.id} style={{ border: &quot;1px solid #ddd&quot;, borderRadius: 8, padding: 12 }}&gt;\n            &lt;img src={t.image} alt={t.artName} style={{ width: &quot;100%&quot;, height: 160, objectFit: &quot;cover&quot;, borderRadius: 6 }} /&gt;\n            &lt;h3 style={{ textTransform: &quot;capitalize&quot; }}&gt;{t.artName}&lt;/h3&gt;\n            &lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Price:&lt;/b&gt; ${t.price}&lt;/p&gt;\n            &lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Brand:&lt;/b&gt; {t.brand}&lt;/p&gt;\n            &lt;Link to={&quot;/detail/&quot; + t.id}&gt;View detail&lt;/Link&gt;\n          &lt;/div&gt;\n        ))}\n        {notOnSale.length === 0 &amp;&amp; &lt;p&gt;No art tools available.&lt;/p&gt;}\n      &lt;/div&gt;\n    &lt;/div&gt;\n  );\n}</code></pre><p><i>Giải thích:</i> <b>useEffect</b> gọi API một lần khi mount, <b>useState</b> lưu dữ liệu, và <b>filter(t =&gt; Number(t.limitedTimeDeal) === 0)</b> chỉ giữ item không giảm giá. Mỗi thẻ hiện <b>artName</b> bắt buộc cùng ảnh, giá, brand và link sang route Detail.</p></div>",
